                                                                                                                                                                                                                    Proposed ToOs and Directors Discretionary Time              ␀1    Harrison                      Fiona                         NULL                          NULL                          USA                           ␀␀XRB       Galactic Binaries, including HMXBs and LMXBs                                                                            ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀                                                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀ToO                                                                                                                     archived  20200429HESSJ1640m465                                     ¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀@ÎÕ°^∫Ÿ@ÎÕ°[¥.30002021028␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀SLEW                    CPMODESTELLAR   POWER     @Ï‡~m≥cø␀␀‡Hea_30Jun2014_V6.16_nustardas_28May14_v1.4.1                                    ␀␀␀␀NuSTAR will undertake a comprehensive program of observations of magnetars and rotation-powered pulsars, designed to study the surprising hard X-ray emission discovered by INTEGRAL from these objects and to shed light on the broad-band spectra between the soft X-ray and high-energy gamma-ray bands. With its sensitive hard X-ray response NuSTAR can extend the soft X-ray spectrum by an order of magnitude in energy, allowing detailed constraints on the high-energy emission mechanisms of these objects.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         Galactic Compact Sources                                    ␀1 