                                 Non-Proposal ToOs                                           ␀	1    Chakrabarty                   Deepto                        NULL                          NULL                                                        ␀TOO                                                                                                                               ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Solar flare CME                                                                                                                   ␀␀␀ToO 2/2 observations                                                                                                    archived  20200429GX_354m0                                          ¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀@ÎÏîîóûg@ÎÏîÈÏÛº30101051001␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀SLEW                    CPMODESTELLAR   POWER     @Ïﬂõµ¶‡␀␀‡‚Hea_30Jun2014_V6.16_nustardas_28May14_v1.4.1                                    ␀␀We propose a 60ks NuSTAR observation of GX 354-0 that will allow us to self-consistently model the reflection in this low mass neutron star X-ray binary and to test relativistic reflection models in the low spin limit. We will put constraints on the non-reflection origin of the observed iron line and obtain further estimates of the neutron star parameters by employing NuSTAR s timing capabilities to measure the kHz QPO present in the source.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   Galactic Compact Sources                                    ␀1    Grinberg                      Victoria                      NULL                          NULL                                                        ␀N01       REFLECTION AND THE INNER ACCRETION FLOW IN NEUTRON STAR LOW MASS X-RAY BINARIES: THE CASE OF GX 354-0                   ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀                                                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀STELLAR                                                                                                                 archived  20150316GX_354m0                                          @pp33333¿@ÏtSéÛM@v#+I∫?r◊s¸PH@oäæﬂ§@@ÎÏîÈÏÛº@ÎÏ√Õ{,†30101051002@Í°/üæ@Ík5À)_@¥zÕûÉ‰@µJÕûÉ‰SCIENCE                 CPMODEINERTIAL  EIGEN     @Ïﬂöå¥á␀␀‡‚Hea_10Apr2020_V6.27.1_nustardas_01Apr20_v1.9.2                                  ␀␀We propose a 60ks NuSTAR observation of GX 354-0 that will allow us to self-consistently model the reflection in this low mass neutron star X-ray binary and to test relativistic reflection models in the low spin limit. We will put constraints on the non-reflection origin of the observed iron line and obtain further estimates of the neutron star parameters by employing NuSTAR s timing capabilities to measure the kHz QPO present in the source.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   Galactic Compact Sources                                    ␀1    Grinberg                      Victoria                      NULL                          NULL                                                        ␀N01       REFLECTION AND THE INNER ACCRETION FLOW IN NEUTRON STAR LOW MASS X-RAY BINARIES: THE CASE OF GX 354-0                   ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀                                                                                                                                  ␀␀␀Data gap due to overwrite of