tardas_28May14_v1.4.1                                    ␀␀␀␀NuSTAR will continue both Galactic and Extragalactic legacy Surveys during the extended mission with programs selected based on community input. One of the principal goals of the NuSTAR extragalactic surveys is to constrain the high-energy X-ray luminosity function and trace its evolution as a function of redshift and AGN obscuration. We will continue to pursue a multi-layer survey strategy, expanding the number of deep fields, and increasing the area of shallow observations through serendipitous sources.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  Active galaxies and Quasars                                 ␀A    Harrison                      Fiona                         NULL                          NULL                          USA                           ␀ELS       Extragalactic Legacy Surveys                                                                                            ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀                                                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀STELLAR                                                                                                                 archived  20150316GOODSN_MOS001                                     @g®ÿD–@O$(ı¬è\@_{ˆ+jÁ’@KVÉ‰%ÆÊ@s,Ú{≤˛≈@ÎÚ…w␀°@ÎÚÓw␀°60110001003@Îâv»¥9X@ÎwÌ(ç@ÌwñFsÅÿ@ÌxVFsÅÿSCIENCE                 CPMODEINERTIAL  EIGEN     @Ïﬂ_Y˙∞º␀␀ﬂúHea_10Apr2020_V6.27.1_nustardas_01Apr20_v1.9.2                                  ␀␀␀␀NuSTAR will continue both Galactic and Extragalactic legacy Surveys during the extended mission with programs selected based on community input. One of the principal goals of the NuSTAR extragalactic surveys is to c