                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       Non-Proposal ToOs                                           ␀	1    Staubert                      Rudiger                       NULL                          NULL                                                        ␀TOO                                                                                                                               ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀                              INTEGRAL                                                                                            ␀␀␀␀DDT (2/2 observations)                                                                                                  archived  20200429GOODSN_MOS002                                     ¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀@ÎÛnw␀°@ÎÛnîØ‰/60110002002␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀SLEW                    CPMODESTELLAR   POWER     @ÏﬂHz·H␀␀ﬂ™Hea_30Jun2014_V6.16_nustardas_28May14_v1.4.1                                    ␀␀␀␀NuSTAR will continue both Galactic and Extragalactic legacy Surveys during the extended mission with programs selected based on community input. One of the principal goals of the NuSTAR extragalactic surveys is to constrain the high-energy X-ray luminosity function and trace its evolution as a function of redshift and AGN obscuration. We will continue to pursue a multi-layer survey strategy, expanding the number of deep fields, and increasing the area of shallow observations through serendipitous sources.                                                                                                                                               