                                                                                                                        archived  20200429IGRJ04288m6702                                    @PºD–©*¿P√>´6z@qrwökP±¿CG™ÕûÉ‰@K≈m\˙≠@Ï‰îØ‰0@ÏÂ"Ë«æ90201023001@vk—N;Õ6@v=N;Õ5®@y@␀␀␀␀␀@y@␀␀␀␀␀SCIENCE                 CPMODESTELLAR   POWER     @ÏÁ_ÃÃÃÕ␀␀·vHea_10Apr2020_V6.27.1_nustardas_01Apr20_v1.9.2                                  ␀␀␀␀Time has been allocated to respond to targets of opportunity during the NuSTAR primary mission. Targets may include, but are not limited to; 1) Core collapse SN and associated shocks, 2) Tidal disruption flare, 3) extreme gamma-ray bursts, 4) Solar flares, 5) SLN SN-1. The response time from a ToO trigger for the NuSTAR observatory is 48 hours, but faster response times are anticipated.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           Non-Proposal ToOs                                           ␀	1    Harrison                      Fiona                         NULL                          NULL                                                        ␀TOO       Targets of Opportunity                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀                                                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀STELLAR                                                                                                                 archived  20200429IGRJ04288m6702                                    @Pπ$›/¿P√{J#9¡@qr±ƒ2 X¿CIŒ_o“@Kaƒ2 W®@ÏÂ"Ë«æ@ÏÕìrh90201023002@ÌpWóˆ+k@Ì`ÒdZ¨@Ôr¢/