C1313 X-1 is the only source for which this is currently possible, so it is vital we take advantage of this unique opportunity.                                                           Galactic Compact Sources                                    ␀1    Walton                        Dominic                       NULL                          NULL                                                        ␀N03       MULTI-EPOCH BROADBAND X-RAY SPECTROSCOPY OF THE ULTRALUMINOUS X-RAY SOURCE NGC1313 X-1                                  ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀                                                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀STELLAR                                                                                                                 archived  20150316NGC_1313_X1                                       @H—QÇ©ì¿Pùp£◊
