trum of the extended lobes. These observations will place the tightest constraints yet on the physics of this fascinating system.                  Active galaxies and Quasars                                 ␀1    Perlman                       E S                           NULL                          NULL                                                        ␀C18       The 3C111 Jet: X-ray Variability, Spectrum & Broadband SED                                                              ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀                                                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀STELLAR                                                                                                                 archived  201503163C_111                                            @P#‰%ÆÊ2@Bˇ
