      Fiona                         NULL                          NULL                                                        ␀TOO       Targets of Opportunity                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Solar CME                                                                                                                         ␀␀␀ToO / Kp=6                                                                                                              archived  20200429IGR_J17528m2022                                   ¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀@Ïpôî»)¯@ÏpôÍM30401004001␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀SLEW                    CPMODESTELLAR   POWER     @ÏÿNÆ]L;␀␀„óHea_30Jun2014_V6.16_nustardas_28May14_v1.4.1                                    ␀␀␀␀NuSTAR will continue both Galactic and Extragalactic legacy Surveys during the extended mission with programs selected based on community input. The goals of the Galactic Legacy Survey are to expose the hidden Milky Way and reveal the wide range of astrophysics that creates high-energy emission. The program will continue NuSTAR studies of flares from Sgr A*, HMXB in a range of environments, and diffuse emission toward the Galactic Center, including the Galactic ridge emission.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               Galactic Compact Sources                                    ␀A    Harrison                      Fiona                         NULL                          NULL                          USA                           ␀GLS       Galactic Plane Legacy Surveys                                                                                           ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀          