          Malgorzata                    NULL                          NULL                                                        ␀N04       COMPTON THICK ENVIRONMENT OF YOUNG RADIO SOURCES CONSTRAINED WITH NUSTAR                                                ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀                                                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀                                                                                                                        archived  20200429S82X_020                                          ¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀@ÏxçÕ´∏1@ÏxéxVb‹60366020001␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀SLEW                    CPMODESTELLAR   POWER     @Ïÿ ä=p§␀␀„◊Hea_30Jun2014_V6.16_nustardas_28May14_v1.4.1                                    ␀␀␀␀NuSTAR will continue both Galactic and Extragalactic legacy Surveys during the extended mission with programs selected based on community input. One of the principal goals of the NuSTAR extragalactic surveys is to constrain the high-energy X-ray luminosity function and trace its evolution as a function of redshift and AGN obscuration. We will continue to pursue a multi-layer survey strategy, expanding the number of deep fields, and increasing the area of shallow observations through serendipitous sources.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  Active galaxies and Quasars                                 ␀A    Harrison                      Fiona                         NULL                          NULL                          USA                           ␀ELS       Extragalactic Legacy Surveys                                                                                            ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀      