                                                                                                                                 ␀␀␀␀SADA rally                                                                                                              archived  20150316HESS_J0632p057                                    @XêŒp:˚@Iﬁ␀—∑@i±ˆîFtø˘Ú‰éäqﬁ@bÂhr∞ ≈@ÏÄx±9Ò@ÏÄyÕ´∏130401006001@jjPH@j;”√a@@lÁ^ûö@lÁ^ûöSCIENCE                 CPMODESTELLAR   POWER     @Ï€·JU∂␀␀ÂôHea_10Apr2020_V6.27.1_nustardas_01Apr20_v1.9.2                                  ␀@ŸWe propose to perform 25 ksec NuStar and 20~ksec XMM-Newton observations of gamma-ray binary HESS J0632+057 prior to its high state in 2018. We aim to detect the break in the spectral slope of the system as the compact object approaches the disk of Be star. The detection of the break in X-ray synchrotron spectral component will allow to test the physical model of the source and make predictions for the position of GeV-TeV break, which could be tested with HESS/MAGIC data.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    Galactic Compact Sources                                    ␀1    Malyshev                      Denys                         NULL                          NULL                                                        ␀X17       Joint XMM-Newton NuStar view of HESS J0632+057                                                                          ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀                                                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀STELLAR                                                                                                                 archived  20200429HESS_