tended mission with programs selected based on community input. The goals of the Galactic Legacy Survey are to expose the hidden Milky Way and reveal the wide range of astrophysics that creates high-energy emission. The program will continue NuSTAR studies of flares from Sgr A*, HMXB in a range of environments, and diffuse emission toward the Galactic Center, including the Galactic ridge emission.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               Galactic Compact Sources                                    ␀A    Harrison                      Fiona                         NULL                          NULL                          USA                           ␀GLS       Galactic Plane Legacy Surveys                                                                                           ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀                                                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀STELLAR                                                                                                                 archived  20150316BG_CMi                                            @\97K∆ß@#ÓóçOﬂ;@j
