 Extragalactic legacy Surveys during the extended mission with programs selected based on community input. One of the principal goals of the NuSTAR extragalactic surveys is to constrain the high-energy X-ray luminosity function and trace its evolution as a function of redshift and AGN obscuration. We will continue to pursue a multi-layer survey strategy, expanding the number of deep fields, and increasing the area of shallow observations through serendipitous sources.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  Active galaxies and Quasars                                 ␀A    Harrison                      Fiona                         NULL                          NULL                          USA                           ␀ELS       Extragalactic Legacy Surveys                                                                                            ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀                                                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀STELLAR                                                                                                                 archived  201503162MASXJ03381036p0114178                            @KE}øHÃ?Û⁄QŒ@g◊
