␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀SLEW                    CPMODESTELLAR   POWER     @ÏÎ#‡ÖÄ␀␀ËHea_30Jun2014_V6.16_nustardas_28May14_v1.4.1                                    ␀␀ÑAfter a 10-year hiatus Mrk590 is rekindling its nuclear activity! Our Swift monitoring strongly suggests that the AGN is likely to turn on again soon. We wish to seize this rare opportunity to document, for the first time ever, the onset of AGN activity when it occurs since this can lead to significant insight on the long-standing issue of how AGNs are fueled. We ask to monitor Mrk590 bi-weekly with Swift and based thereon trigger a joint 3-visit program with NuSTAR and Swift. We aim to establish at which accretion luminosity the expected emission features of a standard accretion disk appear as the AGN turns on. This program is an important part of a broad-scoped, multi-wavelength study of this remarkable AGN.                                                                                 Proposed ToOs and Directors Discretionary Time              ␀1    VESTERGAARD                   MARIANNE                      NULL                          NULL                                                        ␀N05       MONITORING AND TOO OF A RE-AWAKENING AGN: CATCHING THE MONSTER IN THE ACT!                                              ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀                                                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀STELLAR                                                                                                                 archived  20150316Mrk_590                                           @@œˆîFtøÈ…„º”@df®¡T…Ü¿LúPH@sÅÿD–@ÏÎ±9Ò@ÏÎ0#Ü80502630006@‰Eö◊s¸@‰qÏV’–@Âƒ«S&¬@Â«gS&¬SCIENCE                 CPMODEINERTIAL  EIGEN     @ÏÎCI{B_␀␀ËHea_11Aug2020_V6.28_nustardas_19Jun20_v2.0.0                                    ␀␀ÑAfter a 10-year hiatus Mrk590 is rekindling its nuclear activity! Our Swift monitoring strongly suggests that the AGN is