                    ␀␀␀␀Time has been allocated to respond to targets of opportunity during the NuSTAR primary mission. Targets may include, but are not limited to; 1) Core collapse SN and associated shocks, 2) Tidal disruption flare, 3) extreme gamma-ray bursts, 4) Solar flares, 5) SLN SN-1. The response time from a ToO trigger for the NuSTAR observatory is 48 hours, but faster response times are anticipated.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           Non-Proposal ToOs                                           ␀	1    Harrison                      Fiona                         NULL                          NULL                                                        ␀TOO       Targets of Opportunity                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀                                                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀STELLAR                                                                                                                 archived  20150316V1674_Her                                         @q≈∂E° ¡@0ÌÃcÒA @HMÅo␀i@"∂Æ}Vm@TC]ÃcÒA@Ïˇè?r‘£@Ïˇ≠ÍN90701321002@„]9‡ﬁ”@„,v»¥9@‰∫˛g8~@‰ºﬁg8~SCIENCE                 CPMODEINERTIAL  EIGEN     @Ïˇ√à+ù␀␀ËHea_11Aug2020_V6.28_nustardas_19Jun20_v2.0.0                                    ␀␀␀␀Time has been allocated to respond to targets of opportunity during the NuSTAR primary mission. Targets may include, but are not limited to; 1) Core collapse SN and associated shocks, 2) Tidal disruption flare, 3) extreme gamma-ray bursts, 4) Solar flares, 5) SLN SN-1. The response time from a ToO trigger for the NuSTAR observatory is 48 hours, but faster response times are anticipated.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           Non-Proposal ToOs                                           ␀	1    Harrison                      Fiona                         NULL                          NULL                                                        ␀TOO       Targets of Opportunity                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀                                                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀ToO                                                                                                                     archived  202103154U_1543m475                                       ¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀¿X¿␀␀␀␀␀@Ïˇ≠ÍN@ÏˇØ#Ü80702317003␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀SLEW                    CPMODESTELLAR   POWER     @Ïˇ√WÃk∂␀␀ËŒHea_30Jun2014_V6.16_nustardas_28May14_v1.4.1                                    ␀␀;We propose simultaneous NICER and NuSTAR ToO observations of any one of the 19 listed transient black hole X-ray binaries. We request a total of 8 ks of NICER time, split into four 2 ks exposures, each simultaneous with a 20 ks NuSTAR exposure (total of 80 ks NuSTAR time), and each spaced about a week apart.                                                                                                                                                                                                                           