aracterise the spectral curvature and cutoff's of the hard X-ray spectra.                                                                     Active galaxies and Quasars                                 ␀1    Ramakrishnan                  Venkatessh                    NULL                          NULL                                                        ␀N08       CONSTRAINING THE ACCRETION AND JET PROPERTIES OF NEXT GENERATION EHT TARGETS                                            ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀                                                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀STELLAR                                                                                                                 archived  20150316NGC_1600                                          @P¯˝Û∂E¢¿èAÚ◊s@i
