                                                                                                                                        Non-Proposal ToOs                                           ␀	1    Harrison                      Fiona                         NULL                          NULL                                                        ␀	TOO       Targets of Opportunity                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀                                                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀DDT                                                                                                                     archived  20220215SN2012ap                                          @R¿ûÏø±[¿
˙·GÆ{@iPìtºj¿:}óˆ+jË@uâÛ∂E°À@ÌQYxVb‹@ÌQZèFj80802504003@lÔ‘ï*ô@lìˆ˝!ˇ.@n–␀␀␀␀␀@n–␀␀␀␀␀SCIENCE                 CPMODESTELLAR   POWER     @ÌQjú“ﬁ?␀␀Î˚Hea_04Aug2021_V6.29b_nustardas_04May21_v2.1.1                                   fñ˝Contrary to expectations from stellar evolutionary models, recent observations uncovered the ejection of shells of material massive stars in the years before the supernova (SN) explosion. The physical mechanism behind the impulsive mass ejection synchronized with the stellar core-collapse is unclear. Here we propose a coordinated Chandra-NuSTAR effort to map the evolution of the broad-band X-ray spectrum of 1 nearby (d<50 Mpc) strongly interacting SN and enable progress. Our program is designed to characterize the medium around strongly interacting SN, which originate from stellar progenitors with the most extreme mass loss before explosion. The overarching goal is to constrain the nature of the physical process responsible for mass loss in evolved massive stars.                           Proposed ToOs and Directors Discretionary Time              ␀1    Chornock                      Joey                          NULL                          NULL                                                        ␀C23       A broad-band view of Extreme Mass Loss events from Evolved Massive Stars with Chandra+NuSTAR                            ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀                                                                                                                                  ␀␀␀␀STELLAR                                                                                                                 archived  20220215SN2012ap                                          @R¿éäqﬁj¿Åo␀h‹@iPµ'ª¿:~cä	@uèö‘,<ü@ÌQZèFj@ÌQèFj80802504004@ÈòÒ8}ø@ÈUÌ˝ä⁄∫@ÎM•„S¯@ÎM•„S¯SCIENCE                 CPMODEINERTIAL  EIGEN     @ÌQÉŸÅS—␀␀Î˚Hea_04Aug2021_V6.29b_nustardas_04May21_v2.1.1                                   fñ˝Contrary to expectations from stellar evo