se sources. The Swift-UVOT/XRT observations, along with NuSTAR simultaneous spectra, will provide us with broadband, simultaneous multi-wavelength SEDs of the astrophysical objects, that will be tested with theoretical expectations from leptonic and hadronic modelling.                                                                                                                                    Active galaxies and Quasars                                 ␀1    Buson                         Sara                          NULL                          NULL                                                        ␀
